              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kent.schwartz@stryker.com",
              "hideComponent": "false",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"fontsize-8em\">McGRATH</span></span> <span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"fontsize-8em\">MAC</span></span> <span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"fontsize-8em\">video</span></span> <span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"fontsize-8em\">laryngoscope</span></span></span></span></h1>\n<h2>Make your first attempt your best</h2>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Optimizes first-attempt success when compared to direct laryngoscopy,<sup>1,2</sup>&nbsp;while helping minimize exposure to support your safety, too.<sup>3,4</sup></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-8em\">Stryker is a distributor of McGRATH MAC products in the U.S. and Canada markets only.</span></span></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Mar 11 2024 17:29:41 GMT+0000",
